            <ArticleTitle>2016 Pediatric Annual Report: Almost a 10.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>51-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>ICD-10 has several advantages over its predecessor. Some trauma-related highlights include expanded injury codes, a combination of diagnosis/symptom codes to reduce the number of codes necessary to describe a condition, and two additional characters added along with subclassifications to allow laterality and greater specificity in code assignment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
